Keep a shared source as empty text.
Keep a shared good as 0.
Keep a shared verdict as 0.
Keep a shared settled as 0.
Place "abca" into source.

To palm from left (a whole number) with right (a whole number).
Repeat while left is less than right.
The leftsymbol is character left of source.
The rightsymbol is character right of source.
If leftsymbol is not rightsymbol, set good to 0, return.
Add 1 to left.
Subtract 1 from right.

To resolve from first (a whole number) with last (a whole number).
Set settled to 1.
Set verdict to 1.
Set good to 1.
Palm from first plus 1 with last.
If good is 1, return.
Set good to 1.
Palm from first with last minus 1.
If good is 1, return.
Set verdict to 0.

The first is 0.
The last is the last position of source.
Repeat while first is less than last and settled is 0.
The leftsymbol is character first of source.
The rightsymbol is character last of source.
If leftsymbol is not rightsymbol, resolve from first with last.
If leftsymbol is rightsymbol, add 1 to first, subtract 1 from last.

If verdict is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
